Description: Advanced Linux Security Scanner Core
 Sys-Scan is a high-performance C++20 security scanner that performs fast host
 inspection across multiple security domains: processes, network sockets, kernel
 parameters, kernel modules, world-writable paths, SUID/SGID binaries, IOC
 heuristics, and MAC (SELinux/AppArmor) status.
 .
 This package provides the core C++ binary and pre-trained AI models.
 The Python Intelligence Layer is available separately as sys-scan-graph
 on PyPI, which provides AI-powered threat analysis and graph-based correlation.
